  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">.. ^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">의정부에 있는 경기도과학교육원 북부기초과학교육관에서 올해 매달&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">회씩 선생님들께 도움이 되실 수 있는 주제로 교사 세미나를 시행하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">연수는 아닙니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">북부기초과학교육관 교사연수신청 페이지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">(&nbsp;<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp\" target=\"_blank\">http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp</a>&nbsp;)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">에서 신청가능하시고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">혹시 관심있는 주제가 있으시면 신청하시길 바랍니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">. ^^&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">(경기도교사가 아니신 분들은 여기에 댓글을 달고 오심됩니다.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">참가 신청은 매달 말부터 그 다음달 세미나 시작일까지 받습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">현재&nbsp;9</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">월 주제에 대한 신청을 받고 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 11pt;\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">이번은 김영학 선생님이 강의해주십니다! ^^ 관심있는 분들은 많이 참여해주세요~</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; line-height: 34.1333px; font-family: '맑은 고딕';\">&lt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; line-height: 34.1333px;\">전문적학습공동체 활성화를 위한 교사 세미나 실시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; line-height: 34.1333px; font-family: '맑은 고딕';\">&gt;&nbsp;</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 23.8pt; text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">일정</span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;: 2015. 9. 24.(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">목</span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)&nbsp;18:30 ~ 20:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 23.8pt; text-indent: -23.8pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">세미나 주제 </span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">중학교 과학 탐구활동 지도법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 23.8pt; text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">강사 </span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">김영학</span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">성호고등학교 교사</span><span  style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:9.0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&lt; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">교사 세미나 일정</span><span  style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&gt;</span></p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixedborder-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:none;border-right:none;mso-table-overlap:never;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:27.18pt;height:19.48pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:so